cmd-renderdoc-not-loaded = RenderDoc isn't loaded. Start the client with display.renderdoc enabled (the launcher's Development page has a switch for it).

cmd-renderdoc_capture-desc = Captures the next frame(s) with RenderDoc.
cmd-renderdoc_capture-help = Usage: {$command} [frames]
cmd-renderdoc_capture-triggered = RenderDoc will capture {$frames} frame(s).

cmd-renderdoc_ui-desc = Lists RenderDoc captures and opens the RenderDoc UI connected to this client.
cmd-renderdoc_ui-help = Usage: {$command}
cmd-renderdoc_ui-failed = Couldn't start the RenderDoc UI (qrenderdoc next to the RenderDoc library).
